to.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:P_20190309_160031_vHDR_Auto.jpg","a":"Youkid excalibur","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"P 20190309 160031 vHDR Auto"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/P_20190309_153708_vHDR_Auto.jpg/960px-P_20190309_153708_vHDR_Auto.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:P_20190309_153708_vHDR_Auto.jpg","a":"Youkid excalibur","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"P 20190309 153708 vHDR Auto"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/P_20190309_153657_vHDR_Auto.jpg/960px-P_20190309_153657_vHDR_Auto.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:P_20190309_153657_vHDR_Auto.jpg","a":"Youkid excalibur","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"P 20190309 153657 vHDR Auto"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Creek_of_Fengshan_ByZhen.jpg/960px-Creek_of_Fengshan_ByZhen.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Creek_of_Fengshan_ByZhen.jpg","a":"LingZhenWu","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"​鳳山溪貫穿鳳山區南北，全長約8公里，上游來自大樹區下游注入前鎮河最終匯入高雄港，清道光年間，曹謹知縣就是利用鳳山溪流域闢建水圳。早期先民從唐山乘船就是順由鳳山溪在今東便門附近上岸的，因此鳳山城發源地就在此，隨著水運的發達龍山寺、打鐵街、縣衙所在地，城隍廟因應而生。"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Dadong_Wetlands_Park_NO1_ByZhen.jpg/960px-Dadong_Wetlands_Park_NO1_ByZhen.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dadong_Wetlands_Park_NO1_ByZhen.jpg","a":"LingZhenWu","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"​原名為中正公園，創建於1981年，位於大東文化藝術中心對面，經過多年綠美化，園內林木蒼鬱，公園內設有老人活動中心、休息涼亭、相臨的國父紀念館(已於2012年10月左右拆除)、慈恩圖書館等。"}]}